          "delta": "青已移走湿蒲团并清理积水"
        },
        {
          "type": "text-delta",
          "id": "511cfdb6-7798-481d-8bb9-d6252e18d288:text:1",
          "delta": "。今日只用西半边，东侧以"
        },
        {
          "type": "text-delta",
          "id": "511cfdb6-7798-481d-8bb9-d6252e18d288:text:1",
          "delta": "借来的三块木板拦住。林青"
        },
        {
          "type": "text-delta",
          "id": "511cfdb6-7798-481d-8bb9-d6252e18d288:text:1",
          "delta": "明日午后归还木板，若屋顶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text-delta",
          "id": "511cfdb6-7798-481d-8bb9-d6252e18d288:text:1",
          "delta": "未修好便改用绳栏。漏点、"
        },
        {
          "type": "text-delta",
          "id": "511cfdb6-7798-481d-8bb9-d6252e18d288:text:1",
          "delta": "补漏人选和开工时间仍未确"
